\centering
\caption{Representation steering results. Flip rate: fraction of test samples switching answer category. Control: random-direction perturbation of equal magnitude. Bonferroni-corrected significance threshold $p < 0.005$ ($k = 10$). Significant results in bold.$^{\dagger}$}
\label{tab:steering}
\small
