\footnotesize $^{\dagger}$ At $\alpha = +20$, the control flip rate exceeds steering ($p = 0.053$), indicating coherence collapse at extreme perturbation magnitudes. $^{\ddagger}$ Gemma: after correcting a label assignment error.
